## Interface: 16001
## Title: PAD Chat
## Notes: Tribes 2 style quick chat for gamepads. A/X/Y selects messages, LB/RB switches Whisper/Say/Group tabs, D-pad Up/Down picks who to whisper from recent tells and your group, Y on an LFG listing opens the LFG tab with role replies, B cancels.
